{"id":"en_the-secret-side-of-my-rich-husband","title":"The Secret Side of My Rich Husband","titleEn":"The Secret Side of My Rich Husband","description":"Nancy, kind and resilient, agrees to marry Gene—the wealthy family’s notorious “black sheep”—in place of her stepsister, hoping to fund treatment for her gravely ill mother. The man’s scandalous reputation precedes him, but married life reveals a different truth: Gene proves gentle and attentive rather than the rogue gossip suggested. When Nancy lands a position at the company she has always dreamed of joining, a string of coincidences slowly exposes her pretend husband’s real identity. He is the firm’s elusive billionaire founder, operating behind the scenes and quietly pursuing a plan for revenge.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/2b57a0884149b401/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/2b57a0884149b401/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Romance","Comeback","Love-Torture","Contemporary","Superpower","Urban"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh3ig/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-secret-side-of-my-rich-husband_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh3ig/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-secret-side-of-my-rich-husband_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh3ig/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-secret-side-of-my-rich-husband_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh3ig/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-secret-side-of-my-rich-husband_4